<p>This is the cost of a replica kept busy at goodput. Idle capacity, autoscaling headroom, cold starts and Loom's own overhead are not in it; the margin on the <a href="{{ root }}pricing.html">pricing page</a> has to cover them.</p>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="prices">
<h2 id="prices">Price sources</h2>
<p>Hourly prices come from <code>bench/prices.yaml</code>, maintained by hand from public price pages. Every entry records its sources and the date it was checked; entries not yet confirmed are marked unverified and cost math refuses them. Results are ranked at the on-demand price, a public list price anyone can check; spot prices are indicative and move hourly, so the spot column and the price observed when a run launched are shown next to it, never ranked.{% if snapshot.price_book %} Price book last checked {{ snapshot.price_book.last_checked }}.{% endif %}</p>
{% if price_rows %}
{% call scroll_table("prices") %}
<table>
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Instance</th><th scope="col">GPU</th><th scope="col" class="num">On-demand $/h</th><th scope="col" class="num">Spot $/h</th><th scope="col" class="num">Committed 1y $/h</th><th scope="col" class="num">Storage $/GB-month</th><th scope="col">Sources</th><th scope="col">Last checked</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
{% for p in price_rows %}
<tr>
<td>{{ p.instance }}<span class="sub">{{ p.cloud }} / {{ p.region }}</span></td>
<td>{{ p.entry.gpu_count }}×{{ p.entry.gpu }}<span class="sub">{{ p.entry.gpu_memory_gb }} GB each</span></td>
<td class="num">{{ p.entry.on_demand_per_hour|usd(4) }}</td>
<td class="num">{{ p.entry.spot_per_hour|usd(4) if p.entry.spot_per_hour is not none else 'n/a' }}</td>
<td class="num">{{ p.entry.committed_1y_per_hour|usd(4) if p.entry.committed_1y_per_hour is not none else 'n/a' }}</td>
<td class="num">{% if p.storage is not none %}{{ p.storage.per_gb_month|usd(4) }}<span class="sub">{{ p.storage.kind }}{% if not p.storage.verified %}, unverified{% endif %}</span>{% else %}n/a{% endif %}</td>
<td>{% for u in p.entry.sources %}<a href="{{ u }}">{{ u|string|truncate(64, true, '…') }}</a>{% if not loop.last %}<br>{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% if not p.entry.verified %}<span class="sub">unverified: {{ p.entry.note }}</span>{% endif %}</td>
<td class="nowrap">{{ p.entry.last_checked }}</td>
</tr>
{% endfor %}
</tbody>
</table>
{% endcall %}
<p class="section-note">Instances planned in the model registry and used by published results. Hourly prices above are the instance alone; costs add the storage volume each run recorded. The full price book is in <a href="{{ root }}data/prices.json">prices.json</a>.</p>
{% else %}
